      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex (gpt-6-astra), reconciling independent Tibetan-first and English-first proposals. Dbu sems is the established abbreviated two-school expression; gnyis is fused into the explicit enumeration and has no separate numeral. The first snang is linked to the stream's appears, not the earlier quotation appears; the second snang is GMR's sees from the viewpoint of the visual consciousness, with supplied things unwrapped. The complete tshad ma ma yin predicate denies a valid perception; tshad ma owns valid perception and standalone negator ma owns not, while is a stays unwrapped. Yod/med express existing/not existing; mi mtshungs is the distributed negative alternative of the equivalence question and stays omitted. Each stream, pus/blood and visual-consciousness occurrence is distinct; the single yi dvags owns only the first craving spirit. Zhig has no separate indefinite exponent. Temporal, copular and remaining causal framing are omitted where distributed. Both complete source columns and all GMR wording remain verbatim; no master gloss is changed."
